{"id":"524f2623-0520-4ebb-b264-caa43b36494f","createdAt":"2026-10-26T14:14:42.477Z","batchId":"states_claude-sonnet-5-5_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-sonnet-5-5","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"states","prompt":"Two states for a file list: an empty state with an upload call to action, and an error state with a retry button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n.fl-tabs{display:inline-flex;gap:4px;padding:4px;border:1px solid var(--border,#e5e7eb);border-radius:10px}\n.fl-panel{display:none}\n.fl-panel.active{display:block}\n.fl-zone{border:2px dashed var(--border,#d1d5db);border-radius:12px;padding:48px 24px;text-align:center}\n.fl-icon{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:26px;background:rgba(127,127,127,.12);margin-bottom:12px}\n.fl-skel{height:14px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(127,127,127,.15)}\n.fl-zone.drag{background:rgba(127,127,127,.1)}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <div class=\"between\">\n    <div>\n      <h1 class=\"h1\">Project files</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Contracts, briefs and assets for the Harbor Street renovation.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fl-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Preview state\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" data-tab=\"empty\" role=\"tab\">Empty state</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost\" data-tab=\"error\" role=\"tab\">Error state</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <section id=\"empty\" class=\"fl-panel active card stack\">\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Files</div>\n        <div class=\"card-desc\">0 files · 0 MB of 5 GB used</div>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" disabled>Sort: Newest</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fl-zone\" id=\"zone\">\n      <div class=\"fl-icon\">⬆</div>\n      <h3 class=\"h3\">No files yet</h3>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Drag and drop files here, or browse your computer.<br>PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PNG, JPG and ZIP up to 100 MB each.</p>\n      <div class=\"row center gap-sm\" style=\"justify-content:center;margin-top:16px\">\n        <button class=\"btn\" id=\"upload\">Upload files</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\">Import from Drive</button>\n      </div>\n      <input type=\"file\" id=\"picker\" multiple hidden>\n      <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"picked\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">Tip: you can also paste files from your clipboard.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"progress\" aria-label=\"Storage used\"><div style=\"width:0%\"></div></div>\n    <p class=\"small muted\">Uploaded files are visible to everyone with access to this project.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"error\" class=\"fl-panel card stack\">\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Files</div>\n        <div class=\"card-desc\">Last synced 4 minutes ago</div>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-destructive\">Offline</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"alert alert-destructive\" role=\"alert\">\n      <strong>We couldn't load your files.</strong>\n      <div class=\"small\" id=\"errmsg\">The server didn't respond (error 503). Your files are safe — check your connection and try again.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"fl-skel\" style=\"width:70%\"></div>\n      <div class=\"fl-skel\" style=\"width:55%\"></div>\n      <div class=\"fl-skel\" style=\"width:62%\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <button class=\"btn\" id=\"retry\">Retry</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Contact support</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"attempt\">Attempts: 1</p>\n  </section>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var tabs=document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]');\n  tabs.forEach(function(t){t.addEventListener('click',function(){\n    tabs.forEach(function(x){x.classList.add('btn-ghost')});\n    t.classList.remove('btn-ghost');\n    document.querySelectorAll('.fl-panel').forEach(function(p){p.classList.remove('active')});\n    document.getElementById(t.dataset.tab).classList.add('active');\n  })});\n  var picker=document.getElementById('picker'),picked=document.getElementById('picked'),zone=document.getElementById('zone');\n  document.getElementById('upload').onclick=function(){picker.click()};\n  function show(f){if(f.length)picked.textContent=f.length+' file'+(f.length>1?'s':'')+' selected: '+Array.prototype.map.call(f,function(x){return x.name}).join(', ')}\n  picker.onchange=function(){show(picker.files)};\n  zone.ondragover=function(e){e.preventDefault();zone.classList.add('drag')};\n  zone.ondragleave=function(){zone.classList.remove('drag')};\n  zone.ondrop=function(e){e.preventDefault();zone.classList.remove('drag');show(e.dataTransfer.files)};\n  var n=1,btn=document.getElementById('retry');\n  btn.onclick=function(){\n    btn.disabled=true;btn.textContent='Retrying…';\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      n++;btn.disabled=false;btn.textContent='Retry';\n      document.getElementById('attempt').textContent='Attempts: '+n;\n      document.getElementById('errmsg').textContent='Still unable to reach the server (error 503). Please try again in a moment.';\n    },900);\n  };\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[820,"<style"],[1104,">\n.f"],[1105,"l"],[1105,"-t"],[1105,"abs{display:in"],[1105,"line-flex;gap:"],[1105,"4px;padding:4px"],[1105,";border:"],[1120,"1px solid var(--border"],[1156,",#"],[1191,"e"],[1226,"5e7eb);border-"],[1262,"radius:10px}"],[13